@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam ArrowColor #355070
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.1
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 12
  BorderColor #355070
  FontColor #1F2933
}
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Page1 authored view\n\nanchor for the aircraft symbol\npageAnchor = {0.0, -0.7}" as Anchor #D9EDFF
rectangle "Aircraft-local axes\n\n+X = forward\n+Y = right" as UserAxes #EAF4F4
rectangle "Page axes used by the runtime\n\n+Y = upward\n+X = right" as PageAxes #E9F5DB

Anchor --> PageAxes : the aircraft stays fixed here
UserAxes --> PageAxes : userXAxisInPage = {0.0, 1.0}\nforward becomes page up
UserAxes --> PageAxes : userYAxisInPage = {1.0, 0.0}\nright becomes page right

note bottom of PageAxes
The runtime never sees "forward", "right", NM, or radians.
It receives only normal page positions and degrees after projection.
end note
@enduml
